abstract: >-
  A column generation solver for the minimum-cost multicommodity flow problem,
  supporting both path-based and tree-based Dantzig-Wolfe decompositions over a
  shared CG loop. Includes four LP backends (HiGHS, MOSEK, COPT, NVIDIA cuOpt)
  behind one interface, the instance-preparation and benchmark scripts, and the
  result tables reported in the accompanying paper. PROVENANCE.txt pins the
  exact solver versions and host behind those tables.
keywords:
  - multicommodity flow
  - column generation
  - Dantzig-Wolfe decomposition
  - linear programming
  - operations research
